      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The emptiness you describe is a very real state, and it's exhausting to constantly perform normalcy when you feel so fundamentally hollow. If the feeling is the only thing that feels real, then perhaps it's time to let that reality be the focus, rather than fighting it. A different kind of connection, one that acknowledges the void, might be more helpful than trying to force a pretense.",
